Modifications made in spot-revival (2026), per Apache-2.0 section 4(b):
  - clickwheel/click.c: compile-time pin defines; busy loop replaced with pause()
    (approach from thehajime's pizero-2026 fork); signal handling; NO_HAPTIC option;
    UDP sent to loopback explicitly.
  - install/install.sh: DISPLAY_PROFILE (composite | st7789), composite as default;
    ARMv6 (Pi Zero W) support; go-librespot pinned to v0.10.4 with SHA256 verification
    instead of "latest"; rsync/file added to dependencies; pins passed to gcc.
  - install/bin/configure-display.sh (new): config.txt / cmdline.txt display setup,
    tested by tests/test_configure_display.sh.
  - install/bin/select-lcd-fb.sh: no-op when no fbdev config is installed (composite).
  - docs/spotify-callback.html: relay only forwards to *.local or private-IPv4 hosts.
  - install/config/config.env.example: redirect URI options.
  - tools/ui_preview.py, tests/, docs/guide/, docs/wiring/, .github/workflows/: new.

